| **Sun protection (hat, sunscreen)** | Florida sun is strong even in October. |
| **Comfortable shoes** | You’ll be walking a lot inside the visitor complex. |
| **Mobile phone with data** | For the Kennedy Space Center app (maps, showtimes, ticket QR code). |
| **Optional:** **Travel insurance** | Covers rental‑car damage, trip interruption, etc. |

